			"Message": "feat: add support for multiple windows in app and window permissions\n\n- Updated default permissions for the app plugin to include `allow-supports-multiple-windows`.\n- Added new permissions for enabling and denying `supports_multiple_windows` command.\n- Enhanced window plugin permissions to include `allow-activity-name` and `allow-scene-identifier`.\n- Added corresponding deny permissions for `activity_name` and `scene_identifier` commands.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "c7c748bb0dce25923e80d5c6b1573c08e05b421e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-28T04:52:52Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				20
			],
			"Message": "Refactor environment variable names for consistency and clarity\n\n- Replaced occurrences of LAND_* environment variables with more descriptive PascalCase names such as `Skip`, `Ship`, `Lodge`, `Extend`, `Probe`, `Pick`, `Require`, `Spawn`, and `Trace`.\n- Updated related comments and documentation to reflect the new environment variable names.\n- Ensured that all references to the previous LAND_* variables are replaced throughout the codebase, including in logging and configuration functions.\n- Adjusted the logic in various modules to accommodate the new environment variable names while maintaining existing functionality.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "ce8f07da8643093964f0b944ac8d1009092af34b"
		},
